From: root <root@g340-cd52-700-60f9-5561-211-6c32.byted.org>
Date: Mon, 23 Mar 2026 14:46:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(phase1): P0 security and function fixes

Fix 1: Replace new Function() with Bun subprocess isolation in code_execute
- Eliminates eval()-equivalent sandbox escape vulnerability
- Uses process-level isolation via Bun.spawn with minimal env
- Captures structured JSON output from subprocess

Fix 2: chatStream() now mirrors chat() behavior
- Parallel tool execution via groupToolCalls + Promise.all
- Loop detection via loopDetector.check/recordToolCall
- hookRunner.runBeforeToolCall integration

Fix 3: Fix non-existent method calls in entries/cli.ts
- Replace shutdown.on('shutdown', ...) with shutdown.register()
- Replace shutdown.setupSignalHandlers() with shutdown.installSignalHandlers()

Fix 4: Implement [CR-Sec] input sanitization
- Add sanitizeForCard() in card.ts, hitl-renderer.ts
- Add sanitizeCardInput() in message-renderer.ts
- Apply at all 6 marked injection points

Fix 5: Add Zod runtime validation for state tool parameters
- Replace unsafe 'as' type assertions with z.object schemas
- Add validateStateParams helper for consistent error handling
- Covers all 11 state tool executor functions
